{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35871","headline":"和友人喜相遇十首 九 · 李咸用","name":"和友人喜相遇十首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麻衣未识帝城尘，四十爲儒是病身。\n有恨不关衔国耻，无愁直爲倚家贫。\n齐轻东海二高士，汉重商山四老人。\n一种爱闲闲不得，混时行止却应真。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}